  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1163/10/bannertrim-png.png\" alt=\"精靈翅膀鞘翅橫幅\" width=\"2046\" height=\"1098\"></p><hr><p>用這款精靈主題的粉彩鞘翅，讓你的鞘翅飛行增添些許魔法氣息！<br>設計靈感來自典型的小精靈翅膀，旨在呈現如蜻蜓翅膀般的半透明質感，並帶有更具魔法感的乳白色發光效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/VznX8ddb/images/7a2dbd27a1c586eb87b2391d1186e12a9680ef93.png\" alt=\"精靈翅膀鞘翅展示\"></p><p>也來看看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/fairy-wings-elytra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基岩版的精靈翅膀鞘翅</a>！<br>尋找更多精靈主題資源包？快來探索 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252ftRl3fJJM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">花園少女精靈核心系列</a>！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fgarden-gals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gardengals/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"https://